<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/>
<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/></TAB></NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Do not exceed the amount of deleterious material in each size group of coarse aggregate shown in Table 3 below, determined in accordance with the 
test methods shown.</TXT><BRK/>
<TBL><THD><BRK/>
<HL4>TABLE 3</HL4><BRK/>
<HL4>LIMITS OF DELETERIOUS MATERIALS IN COARSE AGGREGATE</HL4><BRK/>
<HL4>FOR AIRFIELD PAVEMENTS</HL4><BRK/>
<HL4>Percentage by Mass</HL4><BRK/>
<BRK/>
                                       <BRK/>
