          Materials <SPS>(h)</SPS>                 Weather    Weather<BRK/>
         ____________                 ______________________<BRK/>
<BRK/></THD>
<BRK/>
  Clay lumps and friable                  0.2        0.2<BRK/>
  particles (<RID>ASTM C142/C142M</RID>)<BRK/>
<BRK/>
